    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-forensic art direction, dramatic headline contrast, restrained cyan/red palette, and polished cards. Desktop hierarchy is convincing, but tablet has excessive dead space and a loose zig-zag evidence flow; mobile becomes a long stack with connectors removed, weakening the narrative. The mobile header loses the product name and shows a visibly truncated “MANDA…” item, while tiny, low-contrast mono labels compromise legibility across viewports.",
